<title>USA: Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the weekly U.S. grain and soybean export inspections due from the U.S. Agriculture Department Monday around 1000 CST are as follows, in millions of bushels.</p>
<p>		     Range	    Prev week</p>
<p> Soybeans	8.0 to 12.0	12,536</p>
<p> All wheat     8.0 to 14.0	12,836</p>
<p> Corn	   22.0 to 27.0	23,644</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
